{"id":108,"name":"الكوثر","transliteration":"Al-Kawthar","translation_fr":"L'abondance","translation_en":"The Abundance","type":"meccan","total_verses":3,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"إِنَّآ أَعۡطَيۡنَٰكَ ٱلۡكَوۡثَرَ","translation_fr":"Nous t'avons certes, accordé l'Abondance","translation_en":"Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muhammad], al-Kawthar","transliteration":"Inna aAAtaynaka alkawthara"},{"id":2,"text":"فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَٱنۡحَرۡ","translation_fr":"Accomplis la Salât pour ton Seigneur et sacrifie","translation_en":"So pray to your Lord and sacrifice [to Him alone]","transliteration":"Fasalli lirabbika wainhar"},{"id":3,"text":"إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ ٱلۡأَبۡتَرُ","translation_fr":"Celui qui te hait sera certes, sans postérité","translation_en":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off","transliteration":"Inna shaniaka huwa alabtaru"}]}